// Data Migration — bulk onboarding of an existing company's data into
// Nexus. §35 Customer Merge and Duplicate Management's principles applied
// here even though this isn't literally a merge: configurable matching
// criteria (phone), explicit manual review of anything ambiguous rather
// than silent auto-decisions, and a full audit trail. Every batch is
// dry-run validated (zero writes) before an explicit, separate commit —
// the point of no return is never a side effect of just uploading a file.
enum ImportEntityType {
